    "detailed_description": "Soulivion II is an immersive fantasy role-playing game with an in-depth demonic companion. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are able to play the story your way, with the player choice being our guiding gameplay mechanic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter finding yourself in the Nowhere, you die entering the afterlife.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is where you start to build out your story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSoulivion II presents the new world of Sorrowmire to battle and explore, along with its three new areas, the hub of Krux Ketch, and portal travel to different realms.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBattle with a sword or bow in live ABS-style combat, a far cry from our standard turn base system.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nActive live combat puts the player first in fighting, unlike our other games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBattle demons, monsters and everything in middle as you attempt the impossible of achieving your desired ending.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWho will you save, enlist, or discover as you traverse the lands?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDominate the afterlife and decide the fate of everything.",
